6.7	preconditions#refusesUnderMachineLocalState	a `.pi/` checkout is accepted only when it is this project's own, i.e. it carries the fixture the suite reads (issue #289)
7.1	foreign#fixtureDeclaresEveryBudgetDefault	a budget default the engine reads is declared by the fixture's configuration, not left to the host's (issue #290)
7.2	foreign#baseBranchIsTheFixturesConfiguration	the foreign project's base branch is its own configuration value, not the engine's default (issue #303)
